<h2 id="problem-description">Problem Description</h2>

<p>These past few days I wanted to align my code and found that the XAlign plugin I often use had stopped working. Looking at the settings, I saw that Xcode Source Editor was missing from the extensions.</p>

<p><img src="/assets/images/20201016XcodeSourceEditorNotWork/XcodeSourceEditor.avif" alt="Xcode Source Editor" /></p>

<p>After searching online, I found a reliable solution, so I’m jotting it down here.</p>

