<p>The cause</p>

<p>When multiple copies of Xcode are on the same machine, extensions may stop working entirely. In this case, Apple Developer Relations suggests re-registering your primary copy of Xcode with Launch Services (the easiest way is to temporarily add lsregister’s location to PATH):</p>

